 "version": 1,
 "title": "Body Music Groove",
 "category": "Drums and grooves",
 "text": "Sound: a complete EBM groove: the galloping sequenced bass with a kick on every beat and hats on the off-beats, ready to play over. It plays by itself; hold a key around C3 to move the bass part's root.\n\nHow it's built: one Clock runs it all. The bass: Clock 1/16 \u2192 Sequencer \u2192 saw into the OTA filter, one short envelope on both the filter and the VCA (a simpler version of Body Music Bass). The kick: a sine with a fast pitch drop on every BEAT. The hats: noise through a high-pass on the off-beats: a second Sequencer stepping on eighths with only the even steps on, so they land between the kicks. A Mixer brings them together.\n\nTweak: TEMPO, the bass steps, the filter's CUTOFF, the drum levels on the mixer.",
